<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #2f2f2f;
        }

        .header {
            background: #d8d8d8;
            color: #1f1f1f;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .container {
            padding: 14px 18px 10px 18px;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 760px;
            font-size: 32px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        th,
        td {
            border: 2px solid #7d7d7d;
            padding: 8px 10px;
        }

        thead th {
            background: #efefef;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
        }

        td.status {
            font-weight: 700;
            width: 44%;
        }

        td.number {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: 700;
            width: 28%;
        }

        tr.sub-row td.status {
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding-left: 44px;
        }

        tr.sub-row td.number {
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        tr.total-row td {
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .footnote {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            margin-top: 12px;
            max-width: 760px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="header">{{headerTitle}}</div>
    <div class="container">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th>Contagem Guardador</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td class="status">Na Fila</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorQueued}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="status">Enviado</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorSent}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="status">Acessado</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorUsed}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="sub-row">
                    <td class="status">Conta Cadastrada</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorUsedComplete}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="sub-row">
                    <td class="status">Conta Não Cadastrada</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorUsedIncomplete}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="total-row">
                    <td class="status">TOTAL</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorTotal}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="status">E-mails Não Cadastrados</td>
                    <td class="number">{{guardadorEmailsNotRegistered}}</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="footnote">
            <strong>Na fila:</strong> usuários aguardando envio de convite.<br>
            <strong>Enviado:</strong> convite encaminhado por e-mail.<br>
            <strong>Acessado:</strong> usuários que concluíram o primeiro acesso.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
